Subject: [PATCH 24/24] PROTOTYPE pvr: cache render targets for up to 32 sizes

The dynamic-rendering render target cache never evicts and held eight
sizes, which one Plasma shell process fills (windows, panels, layers), so
every other size created a render target dataset and its free list for
every render. Hold 32.

